WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.901 --> 00:00:02.901
-Good evening, I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.901 --> 00:00:04.300
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:05.434
And now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.434 --> 00:00:07.434
Today is Valentine's Day,

00:00:07.434 --> 00:00:09.200
so if you're watching
right now,

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:10.367
better luck next year.

00:00:10.367 --> 00:00:12.801
[ Laughter ]

00:00:12.801 --> 00:00:15.868
According to the latest numbers,
the average American

00:00:15.868 --> 00:00:19.200
is expected to spend $200
this year on Valentine's Day.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:22.434
Or $400, if you made her
breakfast in bed.

00:00:22.434 --> 00:00:23.968
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:23.968 --> 00:00:25.934
Eggs are super expensive
right now, guys.

00:00:25.934 --> 00:00:27.167
[ Laughter ]

00:00:27.167 --> 00:00:29.767
That's a joke about, uh,
egg-flation.

00:00:29.767 --> 00:00:31.267
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:31.267 --> 00:00:34.234
That's what Baze calls it.

00:00:34.234 --> 00:00:36.601
In a video today announcing
she's running for president,

00:00:36.601 --> 00:00:39.067
former U.N. ambassador
Nikki Haley said,

00:00:39.067 --> 00:00:41.467
"I don't put up with bullies,
and when you kick back,

00:00:41.467 --> 00:00:43.400
it hurts them more
if you're wearing heels."

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:46.300
Whoa, what job does she
think this is?

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:47.667
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.667 --> 00:00:51.167
Does she want to be president
or teach Krav Maga?

00:00:51.167 --> 00:00:52.667
"When I fight
for the middle class,

00:00:52.667 --> 00:00:56.467
I'll hold my keys so they
stick out between my fingers."

00:00:56.467 --> 00:00:57.901
But she does make
an interesting point, though.

00:00:57.901 --> 00:00:59.634
If she wins, she'd be
the first president

00:00:59.634 --> 00:01:02.701
to wear heels since
the last president.

00:01:02.701 --> 00:01:05.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.033 --> 00:01:07.534
[ Applause ]

00:01:07.534 --> 00:01:11.000
A lawyer for President Trump
said recently

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:13.801
that Trump was using a manilla
folder marked "Classified"

00:01:13.801 --> 00:01:16.701
to block a small light
on a landline phone

00:01:16.701 --> 00:01:18.000
next to his bed.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:20.634
Even weirder, all the ones
that he taped up to use

00:01:20.634 --> 00:01:23.767
in place of curtains.

00:01:23.767 --> 00:01:25.834
Buckingham Palace
yesterday announced

00:01:25.834 --> 00:01:28.100
that Queen Camilla tested
positive for coronavirus.

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:30.734
Luckily, as a royal,
she was already planning on

00:01:30.734 --> 00:01:32.300
doing nothing
for the next two weeks.

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:35.634
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.634 --> 00:01:37.667
The maker of the
robot vacuum cleaner Roomba

00:01:37.667 --> 00:01:39.133
announced yesterday
that the company

00:01:39.133 --> 00:01:41.767
would lay off roughly 7%
of its workforce.

00:01:41.767 --> 00:01:42.934
And since it was Roomba,

00:01:42.934 --> 00:01:45.367
it took everyone 45 minutes
to find the door.

00:01:45.367 --> 00:01:47.934
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.934 --> 00:01:50.534
Finally, according to
a new analysis by Yelp,

00:01:50.534 --> 00:01:52.400
the most romantic restaurant
in Wisconsin

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:53.934
is Grampa's Pizza.

00:01:53.934 --> 00:01:57.067
That story again,
the only restaurant in Wisconsin

00:01:57.067 --> 00:01:59.167
is Grampa's Pizza.

00:01:59.167 --> 00:02:00.901
We got a great show
for you tonight.

00:02:00.901 --> 00:02:02.300
That was a monologue.

